Messenger:

39
00:02:49.991 --> 00:02:52.444
Ciphertext only (end-to-end encryption).

40
00:02:52.724 --> 00:02:53.769
Social feed:

41
00:02:54.049 --> 00:02:56.951
Plaintext; the server ranks, moderates and serves.

42
00:02:57.231 --> 00:02:58.404
Hardest problem.

43
00:02:58.684 --> 00:02:59.559
Messenger:

44
00:02:59.839 --> 00:03:04.297
Reliable delivery to offline, multi-device users; encryption keys.

45
00:03:04.577 --> 00:03:05.623
Social feed:

46
00:03:05.903 --> 00:03:09.743
Ranking billions of candidates; media at scale; moderation.

47
00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.089
Consistency.

48
00:03:11.369 --> 00:03:12.244
Messenger:

49
