Eventual; freshness in seconds is fine.

52
00:03:19.892 --> 00:03:20.703
Traffic.

53
00:03:20.983 --> 00:03:21.857
Messenger:

54
00:03:22.137 --> 00:03:25.359
Enormous message rates, small payloads; media heavy.

55
